  "description": "Experience metapackage bundling Excalibur.Dispatch with SQL Server event sourcing and a SQL Server outbox store. Provides a single AddDispatchWithSqlServer() call for the common SQL Server scenario. The outbox stages messages durably; background delivery is opt-in. PRE-RELEASE: the public API is not frozen and may change between pre-release builds. Not recommended for production use. Known issues: https://docs.excalibur-dispatch.dev/docs/known-issues",
